I'd like to watch them with the very handy reactiveFileReader().

I'd also like to be able to systematically create a bunch of reactiveFileReader objects via, say, lapply(), loosely following the pattern of this fine example <https://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/creating-a-ui-from-a-loop.html>.

